{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01834","headline":"杂曲歌辞 远别离 · 张籍","name":"杂曲歌辞 远别离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莲叶团团杏花拆，长江鲤鱼鳍鬣赤。\n念君少年弃亲戚，千里万里独爲客。\n谁言远别心不易，天星坠地能爲石。\n几时断得城南陌，勿使居人有行役。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01834.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01834","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}